          <div class="rcard"><div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#FDE837"></div><div><b>Yellow</b><span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>The recently tended dot, and one highlighted phrase per page.</span><br><code>#FDE837</code></div></div></div>
