          <div class="spec"><p class="big" style="font-weight:500">DM Sans</p><p>Everything you need to read quickly: body text, dates, buttons, the nav.</p></div>
          <div class="spec"><p class="big" style="font-family:'Shantell Sans',cursive">Handwriting</p><p>Allowed in three places on the whole site. One of them is at the bottom of this page.</p></div>
