  <section>
    <h2>Rules I gave myself</h2>
    <ul class="rules">
      <li>If in doubt, take something away.</li>
      <li>One loud thing per screen.</li>
      <li>The mark is one colour, always.<small>The paths show whatever's behind them. Filling them in would be like paving the garden.</small></li>
      <li>The curl never closes.</li>
      <li>Nothing moves without a reason.<small>The gate on the home page swings open because it's a door. The dots up top walk because paths are for walking.</small></li>
      <li>Pink and yellow are never words.</li>
      <li>Old notes go grey. They never disappear.</li>
      <li>No dark mode, no trackers, no cookie banner.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

